{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013EfHptXwBrGUZznUs31fUo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Pro plan monthly price US\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What is the Pro plan?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/8325606-what-is-the-pro-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Plans & pricing\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Claude Pro \\\\ Anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-pro\"},{\"title\":\"How is my Team plan bill calculated?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9267289-how-is-my-team-plan-bill-calculated\"},{\"title\":\"Buy usage bundles\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14246112-buy-usage-bundles\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Cowork\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/product/cowork\"},{\"title\":\"What is the Team plan?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9266767-what-is-the-team-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code by Anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"Monthly API credits for Max and Team plans\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/17154008-monthly-api-credits-for-max-and-team-plans\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Team plan for scientists\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/16634237-claude-team-plan-for-scientists\"}]\n\nThe US price for the Claude Pro plan is **$20 per month** when billed monthly. Anthropic's official pricing page lists $17 per month with an annual subscription discount ($200 billed up front), or $20 if billed monthly. Anthropic's support article gives the same $20 US figure and notes that price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\n\nPrices can differ by country because some regions include applicable taxes in the displayed price while others add tax at checkout. For the figure in your location, check claude.ai/upgrade.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdo